{"id":"u-0b6d2c32-7c63-4059-bf2c-f0ef40e89fef","src":"community","title":"DEMON MODE | 6-Day Hypertrophy PPL","author":"Jon Bon Giorno, PhD","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/realm-portal","desc":"Unleash what you’ve been suppressing.\n\nDEMON MODE is a 6-day high-volume Push/Pull/Legs program forged in the fire of relentless intensity. Built for lifters who don’t just want to grow — they want to become something else. Something monstrous. Something unstoppable.\n\nThis is not balance. This is obsession. Each session is a ritual in pain, progress, and power — summoning freakish hypertrophy through unholy volume and precision.\n\nWhat to expect:\n\n😈 6-day classic PPL split — optimized for maximal growth\n\n🧠 Dark focus on the mind-muscle connection and brutal execution\n\n🔁 Progressive overload + intensity techniques (drop sets, rest-pause, supersets)\n\n💪 Emphasis on upper chest, back thickness, arm fullness, and leg sweep\n\n🩸 A system designed to push limits, not maintain balance\n\nNo mercy. No off switch. Just pure muscle-building madness. Run for 4 weeks, increase the weights, and keep going deeper into hell.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's","Athletics","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:05:50.511Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["PUSH BABY CHEST COME ON PUSH","PULL NOW YOU PISSER PULL!!!!","LEG DAY GOD DAMNIT DEMON TIME","PUSH BABY SHOULDERS","PULL NOW YOU PISSER PULL!!!!","LEG DAY GOD DAMNIT DEMON TIME"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9},{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8},{"r":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9},{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"V-Handle Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":9},{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":9},{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"One Arm Lateral Raise (